(GOVERNMENT OF INDIA - MINISTRY OF FINANCE) Tj
T*
(OPERATIONAL GUIDELINES: STAND-UP INDIA SCHEME FOR WOMEN AND SC/ST ENTREPRENEURS \(STAND-UP INDIA\) / DEPARTMENT OF FINANCIAL SERVICES \(DFS\) / SIDBI / NABARD) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Overview & Objective:) Tj
T*
(Facilitates bank loans between Rs. 10 Lakh and Rs. 1 Crore to at least one) Tj
T*
(Scheduled Caste \(SC\) or Scheduled Tribe \(ST\) borrower and at least one) Tj
T*
(woman borrower per bank branch for setting up a greenfield enterprise.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Eligibility Criteria:) Tj
T*
(1. SC/ST and/or Woman entrepreneurs above 18 years of age.) Tj
T*
(2. Loans under the scheme are available for only greenfield \(first-time\)) Tj
T*
(   projects.) Tj
T*
(3. In case of non-individual enterprises, 51% shareholding must be held by) Tj
T*
(   SC/ST and/or women.) Tj
T*
(4. Borrower must not be in default to any bank or financial institution.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Financial Assistance and Subsidy:) Tj
T*
(1. Composite loan \(term loan and working capital\) between Rs. 10 Lakh and Rs. 100) Tj
T*
(   Lakh covering up to 85% of project cost at lowest applicable bank) Tj
T*
(   interest rate.) Tj
T*
(3. Maximum financial assistance cap is Rs 1.00 Crore per unit.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Mandatory Documents Checklist:) Tj
T*
(1. Identity and Address Proof \(Aadhaar/PAN\)) Tj
T*
(2. Caste Certificate \(for SC/ST entrepreneurs\)) Tj
T*
(3. Certificate of Incorporation / Partnership Deed showing 51% female/SC/ST) Tj
T*
(   ownership) Tj
T*
(4. Project Report detailing machinery and capital expenditure) Tj
T*
(5. Pollution clearance / licenses if applicable) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Application Procedure:) Tj
T*
(1. Mode: Online via Stand-Up Mitra / Jan Samarth) Tj
T*
(2. Official Portal: https://www.jansamarth.in/stand-up-india-scheme) Tj
T*
ET
